# Docker build context is backend/ (SatelliteTracker.sln + src/).
# .dockerignore patterns are anchored at the context root, so a bare "*.pem" would only
# match backend/*.pem. The "**/" prefix makes each pattern match at any depth (including
# the root itself).
#
# Test projects are deliberately NOT excluded: SatelliteTracker.sln references
# SatelliteTracker.Tests, and `dotnet restore` on the solution fails if it is missing.

# Build output and test results
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/

# Secrets and local-only configuration
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*service-account*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json

# VCS, IDE and user-specific files
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.user
